<title>USA: Warner-Lambert completes buy of Jouveinal.</title>
<headline>Warner-Lambert completes buy of Jouveinal.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS PLAINS, N.J. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warner-Lambert Co said Wednesday it has completed the purchase of the remaining 66 percent of Jouveinal Group it did not already own.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately able to provide information on the purchase price.</p>
<p>In January 1993, Warner-Lambert acquired a 34 percent interest in Jouveinal, a privately held French pharmaceutical group.</p>
<p>Jouveinal achieved sales in 1996 of FF 1.2 billion, or U.S. $222 million, Warner-Lambert said.</p>
</text>
